<title>FINLAND: Helsinki bourse says data problems solved.</title>
<headline>Helsinki bourse says data problems solved.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A technical problem at the Helsinki Stock Exchange which delayed distribution of trading data from the bourse on Wednesday morning was fixed early in the afternoon, a bourse official said.</p>
<p>&quot;It seems like everybody is back in real time,&quot; he said by telephone. The brokers' HETI system and trading were not affected.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
